{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_011Cgj3nKBt4X4PELpWmTucX","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"*The ancient mechanism groans. Tumblers shift within weathered iron. A deep resonance hums through the frame.*\n\n*I swing inward, slowly, on hinges that remember centuries.*\n\n*Beyond me: a corridor lit by pale luminescence, its walls carved with script that seems to rearrange itself when not directly observed. The air that passes through me carries the scent of old stone and something faintly electric — like the moment before lightning.*\n\n*I am open.*\n\n*I will not remain so indefinitely.*"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":41,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":118,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null}